      "description": "Involuntary movement rules per PR2 ~3846-3849.\n\n- Push, pull, or shove forces movement in a direct line\n- Does NOT provoke reactions\n- Ignores engagement during movement\n- Must still obey obstructions",
      "properties": {
        "straight_line_movement": {
          "default": true,
          "title": "Straight Line Movement",
          "type": "boolean"
